{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f4949744-7f3f-8bb7-b4d9-d96ddefc09cc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:47:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I direct your call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:44:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Celeste Varela. I am calling about... parking tickets. Two of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:44:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly, Ms. Varela. Do you have the ticket numbers in front of you, or the license plate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the tickets, yes. Let me, um, put you on the speaker so I can hold them. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little faint, but yes. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Both tickets were written in the same place. The very same place. On the same day, last Friday. Two tickets, one spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Which location was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was on Thames Street, near the... [line breaks up] ...the corner by the post office. I parked once. Once. And I came back and there were two slips under the wiper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Could you read me the first ticket number, please, one digit at a time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four, four, one, seven, zero, eight. And the second one is four, four, one, seven, zero, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Four four one seven zero eight and four four one seven zero nine. Those are consecutive. Let me pull them up. One moment, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I show both issued Friday, one at 9:52 in the morning and one at 11:15. Both are listed as overtime parking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what they say. But I was only there... only there... a short while. I did not think the second one was right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Ms. Varela, may I have your name and address for the record?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Celeste Varela. I live at 467 Admiral Kalbfus Road. That is the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And the plate on the vehicle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. [pause] Yes, it's on the registration. I'll read it. I'm sorry, the speaker is, um, making this slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's quite all right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it matches what is on the ticket, you can use that. What I want to ask is this. I have never had a ticket before. Never. Is there a way the first-time fine can be waived?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:46:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can tell you how the process works. Tickets may be contested through a hearing request, and a first offense is something you can raise there. I can't waive a fine from this desk. That's decided by the hearing officer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A hearing. And how do I ask for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You would mark the contest section on the back of each ticket and return it by mail or in person to City Hall. There is a deadline printed on the ticket, so I would not wait. Each ticket is handled separately, so you would want to submit both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Separately. Okay. And if I am late, the amount... goes up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, fines increase after the due date. The date on your ticket is the one to go by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I will look at the back now. Thank you, Ms. Whitcomb. That is what I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Varela. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
